title: Investigating Domestic Enemies
on-arrival: month_actions += 1
view-if: kcp_in_government = 1 and national_defence_minister_party = "KCP"
#card-image: img/kcp_national_defence.png
#is-card: true
#new-page: true

# this is not a card...

= Investigating Domestic Enemies

As we have control over the Interior Department, we can direct police and intelligence services to investigate internal enemies. We can proscribe various organizations.

- @deport_hitler
- @ban_sa: Ban the regionalist militias
- @unban_sa: Unban the regionalist militias.
- @persecute_sa
- @ban_sh: Ban the monarchist militias.
- @unban_sh: Unban the monarchist militias.
- @persecute_sh
- @ban_rfb: Ban the workers militias.
- @unban_rfb: Unban the workers militias.
- @persecute_rfb
- @root: Take no action for now.

@ban_sa
view-if:  sa_banned == 0
on-arrival: sa_strength *= 0.85; sa_strength *= 0.7 if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.7; sa_banned = 1; vnpf_relation -= 3; interior_police_loyalty -= 0.05; sa_militancy -= 0.05; sa_ban_timer = 6;

As it turns out the regionalist militias have some friends among our police. Their strength lowers but so does our relation with the police.

@unban_sa
view-if: sa_banned = 1
on-arrival: sa_banned = 0; sa_strength += 100; sa_militancy += 0.05; vnpf_relation += 5;

The regionalist militias are no longer banned. They immediately go on a recruiting spree.

@persecute_sa
title: Further persecute the regionalists.
view-if: sa_banned = 1
choose-if: judicial_reform >= 3 and interior_police_loyalty >= 0.7
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The judiciary would not allow this. ?] [? if interior_police_loyalty < 0.7 : The police are too disloyal to be trusted with this. ?]
on-arrival: sa_strength *= 0.7; sa_militancy -= 0.05

We have arrested more regionalist militias leaders and confiscated their weapons.

@ban_sh
on-arrival: sh_strength *= 0.85; sh_strength *= 0.7 if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.7; sh_banned = 1; hp_relation -= 5; interior_police_loyalty -= 0.05;

We have banned the monarchist militias.

@unban_sh
view-if: sh_banned = 1
on-arrival: sh_banned = 0; sh_strength += 100; vnpf_relation += 2;

The monarchist militias are no longer banned.

@persecute_sh
title: Further persecute the Stahlhelm.
view-if: sh_banned = 1
choose-if: judicial_reform >= 4 and interior_police_loyalty >= 0.7
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 4 : The judiciary would not allow this. ?] [? if interior_police_loyalty < 0.7 : The police are too disloyal to be trusted with this. ?]
on-arrival: sh_strength *= 0.7; sh_militancy -= 0.05; dvp_relation -= 5; interior_police_loyalty -= 0.05;

We have arrested more of the monarchist militia leaders and confiscated their weapons.


@ban_rfb
view-if: communist_coalition < 3 and rfb_banned = 0
on-arrival: up_relation -= 15; rfb_strength -= 50; rfb_banned = 1; hp_relation += 5; vnpf_relation += 5; interior_police_loyalty += 0.1; n_rfb_banned += 1;

The ban is enthusiastically carried out by usualy reactionary police, perhaps too enthusiastically.

@unban_rfb
view-if: rfb_banned = 1
on-arrival: rfb_banned = 0; up_relation += 5; rfb_strength += 50; interior_police_loyalty -= 0.05

The workers militias are banned.

@persecute_rfb
title: Further persecute the RFB.
view-if: rfb_banned = 1
on-arrival: rfb_strength *= 0.7; rfb_militancy -= 0.05; up_relation -= 10; hp_relation += 5; vnpf_relation += 5; interior_police_loyalty += 0.1;

We have arrested more of the worker militias leaders and confiscated their weapons.
